.TH ferry-config-list 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-config\-list \- Show every setting
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry config list\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
